Idea attributions
-----------------
No code, data or documentation was copied from the projects below; they informed ideas and patterns only.
If any code is ever vendored, it will be listed with its licence and commit in VENDORED.md.

- bvenkata/legacy2mcp (Apache-2.0 per its API metadata and badge): curated typed read-only tools, JSONL audit
  log, row caps. This project adds masking, structural read-only (no write tool exists) and parity tests.
- hkak03key/cli-wrap-mcp (MIT): argv execution without a shell, validation before interpolation, byte-capped
  output, stdout reserved for the MCP protocol.
- IBM/ibmi-mcp-server (Apache-2.0): curated named tools instead of free queries; one engine feeding both the
  server and the client.
- Tannex/cq (MIT) and AbsaOSS/cobrix (Apache-2.0): copybook/decoder test ideas (offset checks from copybooks).
- AWS CardDemo (Apache-2.0): realistic legacy field-naming ideas only; no files copied.
- pmilet/witness (Apache-2.0): record/replay/diff framing for parity.
- Azure Legacy-Modernization sample (MIT): structural-parity framing; this project's addition is behavioural
  parity with declared tolerances.
